class=3DSpellE>br</span>&gt;Chlorides also only require one litre of acid a=
nd
produce six nuggets when reduced; however, they also require potash on top =
of
the regular charcoal.&lt;<span class=3DSpellE>br</span>&gt;&lt;<span
